        "text": "<p>Hong Kong Technology, International Certification 🏅 <strong>NCCO (Nano Confined Catalytic Oxidation)</strong> technology was invented through the HKUST Entrepreneurship Program in 2003. It can decompose volatile organic compounds in the air, making it the best companion for hypochlorous acid atomization technology.</p><p>During the recent two-year pandemic, NCCO addressed market pain points, enhanced international recognition for the brand, and helped the target brand move beyond Hong Kong's local market towards global partnerships. It created solutions for clean air across various scenarios using NCCO air catalytic technology. NCCO technology has received multiple patents and is adopted by the Hong Kong government and various public and private institutions.</p>",
